bid submitted by the Subcontractor and any signed Scope of Work attached hereto
as an exhibit.

2. CONTRACT PRICE
The Contractor shall pay the Subcontractor the sum of {{ award_amount_formatted }}
as full compensation for the complete and satisfactory performance of the work,
subject to the terms of this agreement.

3. SCHEDULE
The Subcontractor shall commence work on or about {{ start_date_formatted }} and
shall complete the work by {{ end_date_formatted }}, time being of the essence.

4. PAYMENT TERMS
{{ payment_terms }}

5. INSURANCE AND BONDING
The Subcontractor shall maintain insurance and bonding in the amounts required by
the Contractor and shall provide certificates evidencing such coverage prior to
commencing work.

6. GENERAL CONDITIONS
This agreement incorporates the Contractor's general conditions and any exhibits
attached hereto. In the event of a conflict, the terms of this agreement shall
govern. This agreement is binding upon execution by both parties below.
